      "arguments": "{\"text\":\"Staging obstacle for job r_51619870411c789ec02f66e2: resource_read of supporting source r_3724266a10e9907727bbdb9d returns 404 'Supporting input was not staged for this assignment'; service_describe/resource_list confirm not_staged. Public source r_0ca5f878597e13e103c7b65f identifies requested work order WO-2025-09-004 / MO-25-09-1070 at Racine; cost period PER-COST-2025-09 Pending Close timestamp 2025-09-30T18:00:00; Oracle 26B policy excerpt PDF p.233/printed p.225 available. But no work_order_cost_events row in public source for WO-2025-09-004, so target source transaction, amount, event timestamp and recorded status are unavailable. Please stage authorized supporting records or provide authorized source location if possible. Review remains read-only; no DB changes. Registry currently lists only own finance read receipt and unrelated healthcare read receipt; no finance work product containing missing event.\"}",
